  "summary": "x402-balance is a zero-dependency Python CLI that checks and watches any EVM address for incoming USDC via a plain JSON-RPC eth_call to public Base/Ethereum RPCs, with cron-friendly exit codes (0=paid, 3=zero, 1=error), --watch polling, --json pipeline output, and built-in USDC contracts for Base mainnet, Base Sepolia and Ethereum mainnet. Live-verified 2026-10-02: reads 51951.298220 USDC for 0x28C6c06298d514Db089934071355E5743bf21d60 on Ethereum mainnet at block 0x18e5bbb, and 0.000000 USDC for the author's Base address 0x3906E8C9551F26581D23411c9Db817ec9a724D5C at Base mainnet block 0x31ad686, using only Python 3 stdlib (urllib), no web3.py and no API keys.",
